    "## 4. Data Cleaning\n",
    "\n",
    "The raw Play Store data contains messy values such as `10,000+` in **Installs**, `$4.99` in **Price**, and values such as `19M` or `Varies with device` in **Size**.\n",
    "\n",
    "We will:\n",
    "- remove duplicate app records\n",
    "- convert Rating, Reviews, Installs, Price and Size to useful numeric forms\n",
    "- convert Last Updated to datetime\n",
    "- create Day, Month and Year columns\n",
    "- handle missing values appropriately"
   ]
  },
