    "## 15. VADER Sentiment Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "VADER classifies text using a compound sentiment score:\n",
    "- compound >= 0.05 → Positive\n",
    "- compound <= -0.05 → Negative\n",
    "- otherwise → Neutral\n",
    "\n",
    "Install once if needed:\n",
    "\n",
    "`pip install vaderSentiment`"
